    {
      "id": "E4C6A33E5D3C2A71",
      "title": "&f&lInductive Mechanism&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the Inductive Mechanism assembly in the exact listed order.",
        "",
        "&fAssemble one Inductive Mechanism through its complete ordered sequence. Each material application consumes one item; the last Deployer holds the finishing tool. One full loop gives one guaranteed mechanism.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fStart with Precision Mechanism.",
        "&62. &fDeploy Capacitor.",
        "&63. &fDeploy Capacitor.",
        "&64. &fDeploy Fluix Crystal.",
        "&65. &fDeploy Fluix Crystal.",
        "&66. &fDeploy Basic Control Circuit.",
        "&67. &fDeploy Ingot Steel.",
        "&68. &fFinish with Iron Hammer in the last Deployer.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fRepeated ingredients are separate ordered applications. Feed them individually, then extract the finished mechanism into a buffer.",
        "",
        "&c&l! WATCH OUT&r",
        "&fOrdinary finishing tools lose durability. The chapter reward grants the unbreakable version after you complete the workshop."
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "FA4B7E64CE1F51F9"
      ],
      "tasks": [
