      "title": "&f&lInductive Machine&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fComplete the detected item or boss goal below.",
        "",
        "&fDeploy this tier’s mechanism onto its matching casing. Follow the machine’s JEI recipe or the stonecutter output menu for the next equipment choice.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fPut Steel Casing on the belt or depot.",
        "&62. &fDeploy Inductive Mechanism onto it.",
        "&63. &fFollow the machine’s exact recipe: frame plus working parts. Use stonecutting only for listed passive fittings.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fEach machine consumes its own frame and the listed parts. Stock Alloy, sheets, shafts and tools for the complete workshop."
      ],
